window.products.push({"id":812168,"name":"Reusable Grocery Bags by Eliza Huntley – Roomy Shopping Bags – Set of 3 - 13” X 11” X 10” - Sturdy – Stand by Themselves – Heavy Duty Fabric-Reinforce","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kPGTIL1ML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"✅EASY WAY TO SHOP – Carrying groceries has never been easier! These reusable shopping bags feature long handles for effortless carrying. You can use these sturdy bags at the grocery store, the beach, picnics, camping, packing snacks for long car rides or even as a trunk organizer. The options are endless. ✅LARGE CAPACITY – These environmentally-friendly bags measure 13” X 11” X 10” to provide you with a large area to place items. The bags feature a reinforced, removable bottom that allows the bags to hold up to 25 pounds. In addition, the bags have sturdy non-woven fabric and double-stitched handles. ✅BUILT TO LAST – You can use the heavy duty reusable bags over and over again as they are designed to last for years. The bags’ rugged construction means you can stop using flimsy disposable bags that clog our landfills! You can use these cloth bags to hold everything from meat and produce to toys, clothes, books, athletic gear, crafts and more. Just spot clean when needed and use them again and again. ✅STAY OPEN & UPRIGHT – Thanks to the rigid, removable bottom and sturdy fabric these bags always stand upright and open. Both customers and clerks love the convenience of these “green” reusable bags. You can easily add items for a fast, no-fuss checkout! ✅SET OF 3 – You get three bags. The bags are charcoal gray in color. When not in use the bags collapse for compact storage in a closet or cabinet. Just pull the tab to remove the bottom, fold down flat and you're set. To get your reusable shopping bags, click the add to cart button on this page. Your purchase will be backed by a money-back guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kPGTIL1ML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eliza Huntley","source_asin":"B07LB3P1F5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-812168","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07LB3P1F5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07LB3P1F5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
