window.products.push({"id":812371,"name":"Swiss Ortho Sleep, 12\" High-Density, 3 x Layered Reversible Latex & Memory Foam Mattress, w/Bamboo Cover, (Twin)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91GDZrV0ZrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Better Mattress Company, is proud to introduce the all new Swiss Ortho Sleep® mattress in 4 sizes, twin, full, queen, & king. More sensitive to pressure and temperature. A high-density memory foam mattress that molds better to the shape of an individual's body. Swiss Ortho Sleep® is our best Memory Foam Mattress in ultimate quality & comfort yet. Made from genuine extra long lasting combinations of memory foam. It features a phenomenal high-quality multi layered memory foam mattress. Temperature sensitive, body forming, super heavy and high-density mattress with the best cooling technology gel for an excellent night's sleep. Made to fit all body types and weights. We rigorously test for comfort and for long lasting density. The multi-layer memory foam, act as an ultra combination of selected layers for comfort that eliminates pressure points,and tossing & turning at night by contouring to the body. Swiss Ortho Sleep® bestselling mattress ensures our bodies are supported by the slow recovering memory foam. And, the best \"cooling gel\" that gives our body a cooling sensation for a better night sleep. Made from superior materials in the market and it always comes with a 10 year warranty. Every mattress comes with our exclusive soft knitted, breathable, and removable white bamboo cover.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91GDZrV0ZrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Swiss Ortho Sleep","source_asin":"B01M63F2ZN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-812371","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M63F2ZN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M63F2ZN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":812372,"name":"PureFit Spandex Table Covers 6ft Fitted Table Clothes for 6 Foot Rectangle Tables, Elastic Massage Table Cover, Stretch Tablecloth for Party, Wedding,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51dNVAtrwUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MATERIAL AND SIZE: Our stretch table cover is made of 85% polyester and 15% spandex, which makes the tablecloth stretchier and thicker, so the legs of the table inside and the things under the table will not be seen through. 2 packs per package, the 6 foot table cloths can fit tables that measures 72\"L x 30\"W x 30\"H DURABLE POCKET DESIGN: The four-way fitted tablecloth is crafted with 4 reinforced elastic leg pockets to ensure that every part of the table is covered tightly and spandex table cloth is displayed uniformly. Super easy to put on and off, can be installed by 1 person FEATURES: We use durable wrinkle-free, stain resistant fabric for the stretch table clothes, which can protect your indoor and outdoor tables from dust, dirt, and scratches and embellish your events by adding fresh looks to your tables MULTI-OCCASIONS: Our fitted table cover is perfect to be used as folding table cover for wedding and birthday party, vendor display stand, trade show fair and event, banquet, DJ table, lash and massage bed, bar table, dining table etc. It works better than traditional tablecloths since it won't slip around or billow with wind EASY TO CARE: Machine washable with cold water in gentle cycle or hand wash. Use normal detergent. Wash like colors together. Tumble dry on low, do not bleach, do not iron","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51dNVAtrwUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PureFit","source_asin":"B09TKNR3G8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-812372","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TKNR3G8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TKNR3G8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":812373,"name":"GeeGadgets Pop Top Food Storage Container with Airtight Rubber Seal and Push Button Locking Cover, Unique Lid Hook, 2.65 qt, 2.65qt, Square","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718Ofwp7L2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Lock in the freshness & Say goodbye to St a Le we all know air is the enemy of food. Leaving dry goods exposed causes them to oxidize & they quickly become stale. Plus, the scent from unsealed food containers can attract household pests like mice & ants. Eliminate the pests & Say goodbye to stale with these handy pop-top food containers by Ankou. About this Product one touch open & Close-Up> airtight seal preserves freshness & prevents leaks> easy-grip lid hangs on container> durable, clear plastic, so you can see inside Available in 10 sizes- . 9 qtr. (scoop includes>- 1 qtr. (scoop includes>- 1. 7 qtr. (scoop includes>- 1. 8 qtr. (scoop includes>- 2. 11 qtr.- 2. 23 qtr. (scoop includes>- 2. 5 qtr.- 2. 65 qtr.- 3. 1 qtr.- 3. 6 qtr.- 4. 0 keeping food fresh just got easier It's time to throw out those chip-bag clips & unwieldy Vacuum Sealers. With Ankou one touch is all you need to seal in the freshness & Lock in the flavor. Press the button once for an airtight seal, press again to release. It's simple, yet incredibly effective. Our innovative design features a durable silicone gasket that instantly forms an air tight seal, So food stays fresh for longer & liquids don't leak. Plus, the easy-stack design & clear sides make organizing your kitchen a breeze. Mix & match your stack & see at a glance which items need to be restocked. The easy-grip lids hang from the side of the container When not in use, so you won't lose them. These handy containers aren't just for food either. They can be used to organize & store medications, small toys, craft supplies, spare parts & more. At Ankou we're serious about freshness, and we take pride in making quality household items that will make your everyday life a little bit easier. Please let us know if we can be of any assistance. And of course, please let us know if you love your Ankou pop-top containers as much as we do!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718Ofwp7L2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ankou","source_asin":"B0744KTTPV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-812373","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0744KTTPV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0744KTTPV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":812374,"name":"Chandler 4 Corners Artist-Designed Vermont Hand-Hooked Wool Decorative Throw Pillow (8” x 24”)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":57.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BIlya0pCL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"HANDCRAFTED QUALITY: Our natural wool 8 x 24 Vermont pillow is hand hooked by skilled artisans who create long-lasting decorative pillows that are perfect on any bed, couch or rocking chair. NEW ZEALAND WOOLS: Our distinctive 100% natural, non-allergenic, wool pillow covers incorporate pure New Zealand wool, recognized for superior comfort, breathability and lasting quality. ARTIST-DESIGNED: Accomplished Vermont and New England artists, like renowned folk-artist Laura Megroz, create beautiful works of art depicting lodge and lake life including fly fishing, bears, cabins, moose, campfires and other northwoods animals EASY CARE/COMFORTABLE: Our plush poly-fill pillow inserts are easily removed for spot cleaning the wool pillow cover. Our soft pillow inserts bring comfortable cushioning to beds, couches and chairs. SINCE 1993: Established in the historic resort destination of Manchester, Vermont, Chandler 4 Corners has created beautiful handmade home accents for over 25 years. Our décor celebrates healthy, outdoor recreation; the warmth of family traditions; and a lifetime of memories made in special places.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BIlya0pCL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chandler 4 Corners","source_asin":"B00TE9YKZ4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-812374","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00TE9YKZ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00TE9YKZ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":812375,"name":"San Francisco Fog by Philippe Sainte-Laudy, 22x32-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":68.33,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51u8KGdYBEL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a photograph of fog over the Golden Gate Bridge. Photographer by passion for years, Philippe took an immediate liking to photographing landscape and nature. Always in search of the best light and the most original angle, he maintains a constant search for the most beautiful places surrounding him. Philippe prides himself in understanding the complex interactions between light, weather, landscape, the tides, plants and animals. He finds it is important to have a deep respect for this planet and its inhabitants. Philippe hopes that his photography can bring people closer to nature and encourage them to preserve it for future generations. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51u8KGdYBEL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00D0Z9E90","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-812375","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00D0Z9E90","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00D0Z9E90","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
