window.products.push({"id":812505,"name":"304 Stainless Steel Chopsticks Reusable Dishwasher Safe, 5 Pairs 9 Inches Metal Chopsticks Set Multicolor, Titanium Plated Chopsticks","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tgpzk-lYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"(1) FANTASTIC DESIGN - Each chopstick have a textured layer at both ends to help grip food, look decorative and functional. Chopsticks are square design so they don't roll everywhere when you set them down, with somewhat rounded edges for comfort, plus have a nice weight(about 33gram/pair) and balance to them, not too heavy or too light to hold. 23cm(9 inches) long is a nice size for most people. (2) STABLE QUALITY - The shine doesn't fade after multiple uses because they are titanium plated, sturdy shiny and beautiful. These metal chopsticks are made of premium food-safe 304 stainless steel, no metallic taste at all and will not rust, no unhealthy plastic, way more sanitary than disposal ones, great alternative to wood. (3) DELIGHTFUL COLOR VARIETY - Comes in 5 beautiful colors per set: blue, black, gold, rainbow and purple, very elegant and modern looking. If you have 5 people in your family and each constantly use one specific pair, this colorful chopsticks set is right for you. The mesh bag is a nice way to store them, make them easy to take anywhere too. (4) DISHWASHER SAFE CHOP STICKS - Unlike many other materials, and unlike other metal chopsticks with grooves are hard to clean, these stainless steel chopsticks are super easy to clean, you can hand wash them or clean them in the dishwasher, they can hold up very well and continue to look fantastic for a long time. Good lifespan. (5) ENJOY EATING, NICE GIFT CHOICE - You can use chopsticks to eat Chinese food, Japanese food, Korean food, like hotpot, rice, sushi, noodles, ramen, etc. These high quality stainless steel chopsticks can be great gift for someone who love to eat with chopsticks, as birthday gifts, Thanksgiving gifts, Christmas gifts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tgpzk-lYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gaazky","source_asin":"B087JD1W6K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-812505","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087JD1W6K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087JD1W6K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
