window.products.push({"id":812515,"name":"The Lakeside Collection Monogram Wall Hanging Decoration with Distressed Scrollwork Finish - L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41htssFpHsL._AC_.jpg","description":"Add classically styled accent piece to your home with this Monogram Wall Hanging Decoration with Distressed Scrollwork Finish. It features an open scrollwork outer frame while the bold letter has an embossed, vining pattern. Almost 2 feet across, it makes an impressive statement piece in your home. Bronze-look metal hanging design suits any room's existing decor. Metal. Ready to hang. 19-3/4\" dia.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41htssFpHsL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Lakeside Collection","source_asin":"B00GM1GGCM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-812515","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GM1GGCM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GM1GGCM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":812516,"name":"Progressive International Collapsible Funnel, Blue and White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31U09Ej8kAL._AC_.jpg","description":"Reclaim storage space in your kitchen with this innovatively designed collapsible funnel in blue from Progressive International--a great choice for cramped kitchens. It easily funnels liquids, small foods, spices and more. But more than just another convenient kitchen tool, this ingenious funnel vertically collapses to 1/3 of its original size for storage--perfect for saving drawer space as well as conserving space in your dishwasher. The expandable part of the funnel is constructed of durable food-grade silicone that will both hold its shape when used as a bowl as well as offer easy flexibility when collapsing down for storage. And the wide lipped rim is made from rigid plastic. Dishwasher safe. The collapsible funnel is made from durable, flexible silicone. Funnels liquids, spices and more. Collapses to just 1/3 of its size for storage and dishwashing. About Progressive International Progressive International understands that more than a workspace, the contemporary kitchen is the heart of the home where we connect with family and friends. Its in-house designers spend hours in the kitchen coming up with ways to improve on a variety of traditional tasks and tools. Like all good inventors, it all start with imagination and then switches to the practical. Taking ideas from all kinds of places--including suggestions from customers about what they would like to have in their kitchens--the designers tinker, adjust, and think outside the box until they come up with newer and better ways to make cooking more fun, interesting, and efficient. Progressive International has been in the kitchenware business for over thirty years, and its products are sold in the United States, Canada, Europe, South America, and other international markets.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31U09Ej8kAL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Progressive International","source_asin":"B000VI7SOC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-812516","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000VI7SOC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000VI7SOC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":812517,"name":"Ruthy's Textile King Size Sage 500 Thread Count 100% Cotton Sateen Dobby Stripe Sheet Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91rc8PJf1VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Each set contains a flat sheet, a fitted sheet that will fit a mattress up to 15\" and two pillowcases. Machine wash, gentle cycle. Tumble dry low. Available in Queen size, and King size. Beige, Coffee, Light Blue, Sage, Silver,and White. LUXURIOUS QUEEN SIZE SHEET SET DOBBY STRIPE 500 THREAD COUNT 100% cotton sateen DEEP POCKETS SHEET SET CONTAINS; 1 QUEEN FLAT SHEET 1 QUEEN FITTED SHEET 2 STANDARD PILLOW CASES SELLS IN STORES FOR $99.99 SOFTEST SHEET SET YOU WILL EVER SLEEP ON!! MACHINE WASHABLE, DEEP POCKETS FITS UP TO 15 INCH MATTRESS, NO IRONING NEEDED!!!!!!!!! Heavy Weight 100% Cotton Sateen Sheet Set Deep Pocket!!! Wrinkle Free Dobby Stripe Sheet Set!!! fits mattresses up to 15\" Elastic all around for a perfect fit Machine wash, gentle cycle. Tumble dry low","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91rc8PJf1VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ruthy's Textile","source_asin":"B00KGHKAAC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-812517","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KGHKAAC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KGHKAAC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":812518,"name":"JustPaperRoses 50th Year Wedding, Potted Gold-Ribbon Desk Rose, Perfect Present for Wife or Husband","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.64,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615olD2rxRL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"FUN AND HEARTFELT gift idea to celebrate your 50th wedding anniversary, gold is the traditional gift for the 50th anniversary. Great present for him or her! GOLD ROSE is handmade from gold ribbon (not real gold), attached to a high quality floral stem. Single rose is anchored in glued pebbles inside a terra cotta pot - 7\" tall HAPPY 50TH GOLD ANNIVERSARY tag with ladybug attached to floral stem. UNIQUE ANNIVERSARY PRESENT, will bring smiles to your spouse! PURCHASE INCLUDES 1 single gold rose in terra cotta pot. We have years 1-20, 25 and 50 for you too.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615olD2rxRL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JustPaperRoses","source_asin":"B07MJC4QGJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-812518","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MJC4QGJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MJC4QGJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":812519,"name":"YOYUNG Digital Kitchen Timer,Large LCD Display,Loud Alarm, Magnetic Back,Stand,Portable,Stopwatch, Clock (Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K4tfPIMWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"\"Clock Mode  Press MODE until Clock icon appears on LCD screen. Press HOUR to set Clock hour and MIN to set Clock minute. Press START/STOP to switch b/t 12 or 24hr mode (PM appears for 12hr). Countdown Timer Mode  Press MODE until Timer icon appears on LCD screen. Press HOUR to set hour, MIN to set minute and/or SEC to set second. Press START/STOP to start or stop/pause the Timer. To reset Timer, press/hold MIN and SEC keys at same time until display shows \"\"00:00:00\"\", then set HOUR, MIN and/or SEC. Stopwatch Mode  Enter Countdown Timer mode, then press START/STOP for Stopwatch. Press the START/STOP to start or pause. To reset Stopwatch, press/hold MIN and SEC keys at same time until display shows \"\"00:00:00\"\".\" Lagre digits and clear LCD display make you can read easily whereever you are in kitchen. The digits are big and bold, friendly to those whose eyesight are not good. Digital kitchen timer is portable.It is useful not only in kitchen, also can function as waking-up alarm and stopwatch. Kitchen timer is also perfect for homework, exercises,cooking ( egg timer ), doing sports, playing games and classroom activities. 2 AAA batteries(included)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K4tfPIMWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"99cookeys","source_asin":"B075GT4WC3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-812519","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075GT4WC3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075GT4WC3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
