window.products.push({"id":812587,"name":"Queen Sense 24\"x20\" Falstaff Beer Neon Sign Light Lamp HD Vivid Printing Tech Beer Pub Bar Handmade Man Cave HV52","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":264.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tLNpPDTBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"QUALITY MATTERS. This is NOT an ordinary neon sign like others, it's a NEW neon sign with our unique HD VIVID PRINTING Technology! Why neon signs with Vivid Printing? Here are the reasons: Higher Definition: With our Vivid printing Tech, all logos in our signs are printed very clear and displayed with more details. More delicate colors: Our neon sign with Vivid Printing Tech will accurately display the original color of your logos, making a tiny difference visible. Brighter view: The printing board with our Vivid printing Tech reflects at least 30% more light than regular printing, which makes our sign brighter and further to be seen in the dark. Environmentally friendly: Other neon sign with regular printing uses chemistry that form poisonous layers which was exposed to air and then released to the air. While for our signs with our unique vivid printing technology, the printing chemistry is solidated and sealed which will not be released at all, thus create a safer environment in the room. Most people don't know it or don't care about it, but it matters. Original colors LAST for MUCH Longer: Have you noticed that color of printing logo in your sign is fading? As time goes by, regular printings are oxidized which causes the colors fade within 4 to 10 months. Most neon signs with a printing board in current market are made with a rather regular printing on a board, a large part of these signs' logos were even simply printed on a rather outdated self-stick label, whose color will gradually fade within 4 to 10 months. While our neon sign with unique HD vivid printing will keep the original color for at least 3 to 5 years. We offer excellent domestic customer service. Please contact us first if any problem with your order and we will do our best to solve the problem for you ASAP until you are 100% satisfied.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tLNpPDTBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Queen Sense","source_asin":"B07QXG9PJV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-812587","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QXG9PJV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QXG9PJV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
