window.products.push({"id":812677,"name":"Non-Slip Bathtub Mat Shower Floor Mat, 23.6×23.6Inch, Soft PVC Loofah Bath Tub Mats for for Bathroom, Wet Areas, Textured Surface, Quick Drying and Ea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mDNKJ61VL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Have you ever happen any slipping and tripping accidents in your bathroom shower? Can not enjoy a shower or bathe on the wet and slippery floor or bathtub? Spend too much time to clean up and dry your bathtub shower mat?  If you have one or more those question, you should try our new non-slip quick drying bathtub shower mats to solve your problem.  Non-Slip bathroom shower Mat, Keep Your Bath Time Safer.  Bathtub mat with high quality PVC and heavier weight, then you can enjoy the bathing comfortably.  Loofah shower mat, super soft and comfortable when you stand on it, non slip bathtub mat will let you safer in shower and bathe.  To reduce the probability of being fall down with this non-slip shower mats.  To enjoy a safer and satisfied bath time with soft textured bath mat.   Five size for your opinion:  15.7×23.6Inch, 40x60cm  15.7×31.5 Inch, 40x80cm  15.7×39.4Inch, 40x100cm  17.3×29.5inch, 44x75cm  23.6×23.6Inch, 60x60cm  19.7×31.5Inch, 50x80cm   Advantage of bath show mat  Upgraded Non-Slip Design  Thickened & Hollow  Comfortable Feeling & Exfoliating  Easy to Clean & Quick Dry  No Suction Cups & No Float There is always the risk of slipping in a wet environment, prevention of fall : Please rinse the shower mat and hang it to dry after use. Not suitable for bathtubs filled with water. If you do use it on a smooth surface, be sure not to use bath oil or any substance that might cause slippage. Machine washing is not recommended. More details: bath accessories bath mat shower mat show mat non slip bath mat for tub bathtub mat non slim bathtub mat bathtub accessories tub mat shower floor mat","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mDNKJ61VL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TienYow","source_asin":"B0B1542H7D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-812677","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1542H7D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1542H7D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
