window.products.push({"id":812866,"name":"Hobbymaster Traditions Postcard Album (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31N8O+mRBEL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Traditions album features a timeless library-inspired leatherette design, elegant gold accents and easy-to-use 3 ring binding.Includes 25 assorted pages to hold 150 various sized postcards: five 4-pocket (3½\" x 5½\"), fifteen 3-pocket (4\" x 6\") and five 2-pocket (5\" x 7\"). Insert one card per pocket to see both sides, or two cards per pocket, back to back, for maximum capacity. You can add more pages, too.The album cover is richly padded leatherette. The pages are archival safe with no acid, vinyl or PVC to damage your post cards, and the U-V barrier helps prevent fading. The binder is 3\" thick and pages turn smoothly on D-rings.ABOUT PAGE SIZES: The album includes a starter mix of pages to hold various sized postcards including smaller vintage cards. If your collection is mostly larger modern cards you may want to add more 2-pocket or 3-pocket pages which are readily available and inexpensive. Some customers also like to trim one edge of their 4-1/4\" x 6\" cards to more easily fit into the 3-pocket (4\" x 6\") pages. Postcards are not included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31N8O+mRBEL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hobbymaster","source_asin":"B07HDGJZMM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-812866","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HDGJZMM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HDGJZMM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
