window.products.push({"id":812919,"name":"Scalloped oval Cookie Cutter (4 inches)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61j2X0s86oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you have a custom shape or logos in mind please contact us for your unique custom orders. This listing is for Scalloped oval Cookie Cutter. The sizes are approximately as shown. great size to make cookies for any fun occasions. The depth are about 1/2” deep enough to make thick size cookies. All cookie cutters are made printed by a quality high resolution 70 microns 3D printer at the time of order. Most cookie cutters will probably be blue but color may vary. This item is not dishwasher safe, hand wash only. Prolonged exposure to moisture and direct sunlight should be avoided.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61j2X0s86oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Arbi Design","source_asin":"B01MDNRX3A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-812919","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MDNRX3A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MDNRX3A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":812920,"name":"23 Bees, Macrame Wall Hanging Dream Catcher, Large Handmade Crochet Decor for Bedroom, Big Woven Boho Tapestry Dreamcatcher, Chic Rope Art Decorations","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/911xh+tBxWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FILL YOUR HOME WITH LOVE, LIGHT and POSITIVE ENERGY - Originally known as the “sacred hoops” dream catchers can be traced back to the Native American tribe - Ojibwe. Dreamcatchers were used to protect sleepers of bad dreams. This set of 3 large macrame wall hanging were perfectly designed to radiate protective and positive energy into your home. Display the handmade macrame dreamcatcher collection together in any room to create an interior environment that will be filled with warmth and love. BOHEMIAN DESIGN - We designed this simplistically beautiful and unique set of three to help provide you with visual interest and a relaxed spirit for your home. Our handmade artistic macrame wall hanging set will add to your cozy home spaces and make for cultured talking points. The set features cotton rope and natural wood beads. Hang in a bedroom, living room, office, nursery etc.. - any space will welcome these eclect glam dreamcatchers. This set pairs perfectly with botanicals. THE WEDDING DECORATIONS OF YOUR DREAMS - Your dreams of an enchanted boho fairytale wedding can come true. Use these gorgeous bohemian macrame wall hanging dreamcatcher decor set to help create a soft and romantic feel and become inspired with the beautiful outdoors. This decor set exudes a rustic and natural feel that will be the finishing touch to the day you will remember for the rest of your lives. GIVE THE PERFECT GIFT - Celebrate your loved ones by giving them the perfect earthy boho chic macrame wall hanging home decoration. This set of three radiates positive energy and warmth and will leave a lasting impression. Pair with a botanical for the ultimate gift for your special someone. Set is 1 large dreamcatcher and 2 medium sized dreamcatchers DIMENSIONS - 1 large measures - 12” diameter x 24” tall , 2 medium measures - 10” diameter x 20” tall. ** Click the \"ADD TO CART\" button and order now! This product is backed up by our 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE and outstanding customer service for no-risk purchasing.**","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/911xh+tBxWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"23 Bees","source_asin":"B07MKDLFFR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-812920","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MKDLFFR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MKDLFFR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
