window.products.push({"id":812923,"name":"TreeWool Decorative Grommet Curtain Panel Drape Trellis Accent for Living Room Bedroom Window Treatment (Set of 2 Panels, 48\" x 96\", Navy Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ovzKV3T1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Brand : TreeWool Box Contains : 2 Cotton Curtain Panels only. No other accessories included.  These products are carefully hand finished to give you superior quality Curtains that are sure to add charm to your living room, lounge or bedroom. Product Features : 1. Each unit is made with high quality 100% cotton canvas for durability  2. Each panel has 8 Grommet / Eyelet large enough for use with any standard curtain rod up to 1.5\" diameter  3. 2 panels in a pack, entirely handmade.  4. The are designed to be used as decorative panels 5. They will not block the light completely, but will block up to 85%. About TreeWool : At TreeWool, we are passionate about providing premium quality products at affordable price for every household. As much as we care about the quality of our products, we are also equally passionate about providing all our customers a great buying experience.  We bring our expertise in Home Fashion sector in Europe to the US, so you can buy our products with confidence.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ovzKV3T1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TreeWool","source_asin":"B0745K2LS7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-812923","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0745K2LS7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0745K2LS7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":812924,"name":"DHP Ashby Bed Upholstered in Grey Linen with Tufted Detailing, Bentwood Slat Support System, Twin Size","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VGz4abpRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Want to add a touch of modern chic to your bedroom? Look no further than the Ashby bed! The grey linen upholstery with tufted details is all the rage, and we’ve added a pop of white piping and buttons for a little extra class. The frame is made of metal and wood for stability, plus the innovative bentwood slat system is designed to move with you, provide full back support and distribute pressure evenly. The slats also allow air to pass freely under your mattress, keeping it fresher for longer. The Ashby is finished with wood legs for a rich look, and includes center legs for additional support. No box spring needed! Just top this stylish bed frame with your favorite mattress, colorful sheets and a down pillow or two, and settle down for a long, restful night’s sleep. Sweet dreams!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VGz4abpRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DHP","source_asin":"B073DWXW6M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-812924","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073DWXW6M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073DWXW6M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":812925,"name":"VAPSINT® Practical Green 3-Piece Heat Resistant Silicone Different Shapes Mixing Cake Cream Spatula, Hygienic Solid Coating Silicone Spatula","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cEm-FO6YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DETAILS Model: Spatula Type: Silicone Spatula Non-stick Features: Silicone spatulas are used by home cooks and professional chefs. Because of its non-stick nature, you just requires less butter and oil before baking, thereby decreasing the fat content in the prepared food. Also an ideal tool for thinly spreading or smoothing pastes and frostings due to its thin, flexible edges Heat-resistant Features: Highly heat resistant can withstand up to 600 degrees Fahrenheit.Heat resistant silicone provides optimal utility with just the right amount of flex. Comfort Grip Features: Spatula handle is made to allow firm and comfortable grip while flipping or transferring food items. The thick comfortable handle can't get hot easily and you can hold it for long periods of time Easy To Clean Feature: Silicone Spatula can be cleaned in the same way as regular cooking utensils, either by hand or in the dishwasher. Abrasive cleaning pads can scratch the surface of silicone and should be avoided. Size: small- and medium-sized spatulas plus large-sized spoon-style spatula","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cEm-FO6YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VAPSINT","source_asin":"B01EL4YLY6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-812925","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01EL4YLY6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01EL4YLY6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":812926,"name":"Eccolo Made in Italy Contadina Album With Wood Covers and Tooled Leather Spine With 50 Ivory Pages, 9 x 12-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xXAANbhUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A truly original piece, the Contadina album features Eccolo's hallmark Italian leather on the spine and closures. Rustic, antiqued wood covering both front and back, with 50 ivory pages. Evoke lovely memories with your treasured photos in this priceless album manufactured with pride by experienced craftsmen utilizing the finest workmanship. The ancient craft used to produce this modern-age gift item, assures an everlasting and appealing showpiece for your friends, loved ones or even yourself. Give this unique elegant leather album for a joyous occasion, as a house warming gift or keep it for your own prized photographs. The scrapbook-style pages allow you to incorporate other special mementos like fabric swatches and wedding stationery, too. To fill your album, simply paste or glue your photos and mementos to the heavy cardstock pages with archival glue. Archival photo corners can add a vintage touch as well. The vellum interleaves are there to protect your memories, simply let this sheet lay over the pages when done. Available in two sizes: 14 x 14-inch and 9 x 12-inch. Eccolo is a family owned business based in Brooklyn, New York. We craft and import the finest frames, albums, journals, and gifts from Italy, overseeing the process with the utmost care. Seeking out the best quality materials and partnering with craftsmen in classic cities like Florence to bring only the best to our valued customers. In keeping with our tradition to bring the finest to market, we also work on the mystical Isle of Murano in the Venetian lagoon. Our glass-blowers combine age old techniques and precious metals, like 25-Karat gold to create some these masterpieces. When you choose Eccolo, you are choosing an heirloom.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xXAANbhUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eccolo","source_asin":"B008AFG7F4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-812926","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008AFG7F4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008AFG7F4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
